Risk and fallback:
- Risk 1: ED unreachable in Chen2020 architecture space → escalate to Stage 2 system switch (OKane2022) or electrode modification. Fallback route: material issue → Stage 2.
- Risk 2: plating at 4C → architecture (particle size, N/P, porosity) + electrolyte transport. Fallback → Stage 3.
